, along with balance adjustments and more. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46259721/2739396154f70cd5a1038da5847ec501d1973065.png 1. New Mode: \"Auto Battle Rush\" A new mode, \"Auto Battle Rush\", has been added to the title screen. Gather allies in the Shop, place them on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:03:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689536","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5076510-1844751498220729","game_id":"steam-5076510","kind":"announcement","title":"周回強化の初期化、コントローラ操作、チュートリアルを実装","summary":"Thank you for playing Monmusu Rush. The game has been updated to version 1.0.6. This update centers on three additions: resetting run-to-run upgrades, controller support, and a tutorial. \"Reset to Default\" buttons for run-to-run upgrades Reset your Shop purchases A \"Reset to Default\" button has been added to the Shop. Everything you have bought is returned to its unpurchased state at once. All Prism Gummies you spent are refunded in full, so you can freely try rebuilding your setup from scratch.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T09:03:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220729","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5076510-1843481262701387","game_id":"steam-5076510","kind":"announcement","title":"UI improvements, bug fixes and more - 9 changes in total","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo. The ver1.0.5T update is now live. This update contains 4 bug fixes and 5 additions/changes, for a total of 9 changes. Bug Fixes Fixed a bug where Thunder- and Earth-attribute Gummies could be mixed into the Gummies obtained at the start via the \"Gummy Seed\" effect. Fixed a bug where Redraw could not be selected when the deck went from 0 cards to having cards again through a Retreat. Fixed a bug where, after purchasing a card, the prices of cards you could no longe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T11:09:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701387","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5076510-1842846814455110","game_id":"steam-5076510","kind":"announcement","title":"9 Changes: Help Additions, UI Improvements, Bug Fixes and More","summary":"Update ver1.0.4 Now Available Thank you for playing the Monmusu Rush Demo. Based on the feedback and comments we have received from players, we have expanded the in-game Help, improved the UI, and fixed several bugs. Help Additions Added a note to the Help stating that item cards are consumed when used. Added \"Repositioning\" and \"Retreat\" entries to the Help. Added a \"Knock Out Forecast\" (× mark) entry to the Help. UI Improvements Changed the color of the \"Fusion\" indicator in battle to yellow t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T09:21:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455110","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5076510-1842212951309325","game_id":"steam-5076510","kind":"update","title":"UI Improvement Update","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo.Based on requests from players, ver1.0.3T brings four improvements, mainly to the interface and controls.- Update details1. Clearer description for \"Return to Title\"The description of the \"Return to Title\" button on the Settings screen now includes the words \"Save and Quit\". You can tell before selecting it that your progress will be saved as suspend data.2. Warning when selecting \"New Game\"A warning is now displayed if you select \"New Game\" while suspend save data","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T07:20:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951309325","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5076510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:17Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5076510":"2026-10-26T08:00:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5076510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:17Z"},"5113130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:18Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5076510","app_id":5076510,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:24Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"84981477f2ac5c9acc873eb5813dd76363add1c560e569317bb25a5f29127497","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"몬무스들을 모아서, 육성하고, 배틀! 몬무스끼리의 조합과 스킬 습득으로 최강의 팀 편성을 노려 보세요! 비동기 대전 모드 「오토 배틀 러시」에서는 다른 플레이어가 등록한 팀에 도전할 수도 있습니다!","publishers":[{"name":"あとらそふと"}],"developers":[{"name":"あとらそふと"},{"name":"Atorasoft"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793084400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"オートバトルラッシュPV","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792972783","